    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d352">

                <pb facs="0499" n="419" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg419"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. van Roijen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Netherlands Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New London,
                                Conn.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1901-09-15"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                    1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am commissioned to express to your excellency the profound sympathy felt by my
                    Government for the American people under these sorrowful circumstances.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Van Roijen.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
